WEBVTT

00:08.770 --> 00:15.410
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.410 --> 00:18.710
<b>I just reached my hand out like a daredevil</b>

00:18.710 --> 00:22.020
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:22.020 --> 00:27.480
<b>No matter what I get, I won't ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.660 --> 00:34.600
<b>Escape from the gaps in your
tangled up heart</b>

00:34.600 --> 00:36.670
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.670 --> 00:41.900
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.900 --> 00:44.940
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:48.210
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:51.850
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.850 --> 00:55.440
<b>Right away</b>

01:06.030 --> 01:08.060
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.060 --> 01:13.300
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.300 --> 01:16.400
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.400 --> 01:19.640
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.640 --> 01:23.210
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.210 --> 01:25.870
<b>Right away</b>

01:37.590 --> 01:40.860
<b>I'm starving! Aren't we there yet?!</b>

01:40.860 --> 01:43.770
<b>Is that all you ever say, you stupid monkey?!</b>

01:43.770 --> 01:46.170
<b>That comeback's become
a patterned response too.</b>

01:46.170 --> 01:48.260
<b>Yes, yes, here we go.</b>

01:51.510 --> 01:53.110
<b>Why did you stop?!</b>

01:53.110 --> 01:56.410
<b>There aren't any red lights way
up in the mountains here!</b>

01:56.410 --> 01:57.900
<b>It's a red light.</b>

02:07.090 --> 02:09.220
<b>What a senseless thing to do.</b>

02:09.220 --> 02:11.090
<b>Is this the work of demons after all?</b>

02:11.890 --> 02:13.690
<b>Considering the number of wagons...</b>

02:14.860 --> 02:17.230
<b>There are too few corpses.</b>

02:20.000 --> 02:20.840
<b>Goku!</b>

02:20.840 --> 02:22.300
<b>Is he alive?</b>

02:24.910 --> 02:26.400
<b>Hang on!</b>

02:27.280 --> 02:30.180
<b>My companions were kidnapped by demons.</b>

02:32.280 --> 02:34.440
<b>Please, save them.</b>

02:35.320 --> 02:37.180
<b>Another bothersome issue.</b>

02:52.800 --> 02:55.570
<b>A Founding Scripture of Heaven and Earth
in a place like that?!</b>

02:56.970 --> 03:00.530
<b>It's just a flimsy rumor circulating
among the demons.</b>

03:01.280 --> 03:02.840
<b>It's probably nonsense anyway.</b>

03:02.840 --> 03:04.870
<b>Shien, what do you think?</b>

03:05.980 --> 03:09.850
<b>The probability may only be as
good as winning a lottery,</b>

03:09.850 --> 03:11.550
<b>but I don't know about ignoring it.</b>

03:12.550 --> 03:14.020
<b>I see.</b>

03:15.820 --> 03:17.880
<b>Well, I guess it can't be helped then.</b>

03:19.490 --> 03:20.530
<b>Zenon?</b>

03:20.530 --> 03:23.130
<b>I'll go play the lottery for you.</b>

03:23.130 --> 03:26.500
<b>Let's have a huge party if I win first place.</b>

03:28.140 --> 03:29.600
<b>Honestly.</b>

03:43.820 --> 03:45.290
<b>So that's the village?</b>

03:46.290 --> 03:47.760
<b>What?</b>

03:59.670 --> 04:01.260
<b>There! Here's another one!</b>

04:03.070 --> 04:04.070
<b>Who's there?!</b>

04:04.070 --> 04:05.940
<b>You dare to oppose us?!</b>

04:08.740 --> 04:13.010
<b>I can't let you do this. I've still got
business with this village.</b>

04:20.490 --> 04:22.520
<b>That can't be!</b>

04:22.520 --> 04:23.990
<b>A machine gun!</b>

04:29.800 --> 04:31.270
<b>Out of the way!</b>

04:35.770 --> 04:39.440
<b>Good grief, what a rude greeting.</b>

04:39.440 --> 04:40.910
<b>I'm against violence!</b>

04:41.480 --> 04:43.180
<b>Who the hell are you guys?!</b>

04:43.180 --> 04:45.280
<b>We don't want to move around too much.</b>

04:45.280 --> 04:47.350
<b>That's right, it'll make me hungrier.</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:48.820
<b>Don't mess with us!</b>

04:49.480 --> 04:50.950
<b>They're strong!</b>

04:54.290 --> 04:56.060
<b>Stop!</b>

04:56.060 --> 04:57.520
<b>Wait, Goku.</b>

05:03.370 --> 05:04.700
<b>You guys...</b>

05:04.700 --> 05:06.300
<b>You're Zenon!</b>

05:06.300 --> 05:08.670
<b>Were those guys your minions?</b>

05:12.370 --> 05:14.110
<b>I guess not.</b>

05:14.110 --> 05:17.150
<b>Are you guys here looking for
the Scripture too?</b>

05:17.150 --> 05:18.700
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

05:20.550 --> 05:22.570
<b>Shunei! Shunei!</b>

05:27.120 --> 05:31.320
<b>All the money you've got! And food!
Bring it to me right away!</b>

05:32.260 --> 05:34.750
<b>If you don't do what I say, I can't
guarantee this kid's safety!</b>

05:35.560 --> 05:38.130
<b>He's got no way to escape,
so now it's on to hostages.</b>

05:38.130 --> 05:40.570
<b>The things he does are so typical.</b>

05:40.570 --> 05:42.740
<b>What are we going to do, Gojyo?</b>

05:42.740 --> 05:44.400
<b>What the heck can you do?</b>

05:46.040 --> 05:48.530
<b>I'm telling you to be quiet and watch.</b>

05:50.710 --> 05:54.150
<b>Quit joking! What can you do alone?</b>

05:54.150 --> 05:56.410
<b>More than you two put together.</b>

05:57.220 --> 05:58.710
<b>You guys stay where you are too!</b>

05:59.350 --> 06:02.320
<b>You bastard, I'll take care of you first!</b>

06:06.330 --> 06:07.790
<b>Get down, kid!</b>

06:13.500 --> 06:16.740
<b>Hey, hey, when'd you set all that up?</b>

06:16.740 --> 06:18.540
<b>That's why I always say you're slow!</b>

06:19.670 --> 06:21.140
<b>Can you stand?</b>

06:34.320 --> 06:37.030
<b>We can't offer you much in the
way of a welcome,</b>

06:37.030 --> 06:38.490
<b>but please make yourselves at home.</b>

06:39.430 --> 06:40.890
<b>Thanks for the food!</b>

06:41.560 --> 06:45.760
<b>So, what's an adjutant of the
Homura Army doing here?</b>

06:46.970 --> 06:50.940
<b>I feel like going out on a
walk alone sometimes.</b>

06:50.940 --> 06:54.170
<b>Weren't you saying something
about a Scripture earlier?</b>

06:55.540 --> 06:58.640
<b>You probably heard me wrong.
I have no idea.</b>

07:01.050 --> 07:03.220
<b>What are YOU guys doing here?</b>

07:03.220 --> 07:08.120
<b>Isn't it kinda rare for the happy
foursome to be acting separately?</b>

07:08.120 --> 07:10.590
<b>It's not like we're together
because we wanna be.</b>

07:15.030 --> 07:17.730
<b>So, Sanzo and Hakkai are
supposed to catch up</b>

07:17.730 --> 07:21.200
<b>after taking that critically
wounded man to a doctor.</b>

07:21.200 --> 07:24.240
<b>They'll probably get to this
village around tomorrow.</b>

07:24.240 --> 07:27.280
<b>But demons kidnapping humans?</b>

07:27.280 --> 07:32.180
<b>I don't think so, but it wasn't you
guys who did it, was it?</b>

07:32.180 --> 07:34.550
<b>I hate petty tactics.</b>

07:34.550 --> 07:37.180
<b>I guess it's the work of the
Gyumaoh side after all.</b>

07:37.890 --> 07:41.150
<b>Meaning it's pointless for us to fight here.</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:45.260
<b>Seconds!</b>

07:45.260 --> 07:47.020
<b>You have no sense of tension!</b>

07:49.700 --> 07:51.190
<b>Please, this way.</b>

07:55.670 --> 07:57.930
<b>If you need anything, please let me know.</b>

07:58.770 --> 08:02.540
<b>You're the kid the demon took hostage.</b>

08:02.540 --> 08:06.980
<b>My name's Shunei. Thank you very much
for what you did today.</b>

08:08.680 --> 08:11.410
<b>I guess my son would be about
his age if he were alive.</b>

08:13.620 --> 08:15.090
<b>Is there something?</b>

08:17.830 --> 08:20.320
<b>Well, is there something I can get for you?</b>

08:22.200 --> 08:24.190
<b>No, it's nothing.</b>

08:32.370 --> 08:35.500
<b>Sheesh, it's not like me to think
about those things.</b>

08:50.260 --> 08:55.960
<b>No, I've never heard of this village
having such a grand thing.</b>

08:55.960 --> 08:58.020
<b>I see, thanks for your trouble.</b>

09:00.670 --> 09:02.500
<b>It was nonsense after all.</b>

09:07.180 --> 09:08.840
<b>You're in the way, Shunei!</b>

09:09.840 --> 09:12.280
<b>Quit just standing around like an idiot!</b>

09:12.280 --> 09:15.180
<b>That's why you got taken
hostage by demons!</b>

09:18.550 --> 09:20.020
<b>Sheesh...</b>

09:26.830 --> 09:28.300
<b>Don't you hate it?</b>

09:28.830 --> 09:30.760
<b>But it's the truth.</b>

09:31.530 --> 09:34.060
<b>I asked if you hated it or not.</b>

09:35.270 --> 09:40.380
<b>Sure, I do, but I'd never stand a chance
against them in a fight.</b>

09:40.380 --> 09:42.540
<b>What's the point of losing
even before you begin?!</b>

09:43.580 --> 09:47.310
<b>If I were your father, I'd kick your
ass to go get revenge, but...</b>

09:48.280 --> 09:53.690
<b>You live with your grandparents at that inn?</b>

09:54.790 --> 09:56.260
<b>What about your parents?</b>

09:58.690 --> 10:01.030
<b>They were killed by demons.</b>

10:03.360 --> 10:06.560
<b>Demons have attacked us
several times before too.</b>

10:07.870 --> 10:11.000
<b>And each time, lots of people get killed.</b>

10:11.710 --> 10:13.230
<b>I didn't know.</b>

10:17.350 --> 10:18.810
<b>Mirei!</b>

10:22.080 --> 10:23.990
<b>You bastard!</b>

10:23.990 --> 10:25.890
<b>There's your wife.</b>

10:25.890 --> 10:28.660
<b>She wouldn't do as I said to the very end.</b>

10:28.660 --> 10:31.360
<b>It's all this woman's fault.</b>

10:31.360 --> 10:33.730
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

10:33.730 --> 10:36.460
<b>You wouldn't actually kill me, would you?</b>

10:36.460 --> 10:39.200
<b>Gods don't kill after all, right?</b>

10:39.200 --> 10:40.940
<b>Bastard!</b>

10:40.940 --> 10:42.400
<b>An illusion?!</b>

10:43.400 --> 10:45.110
<b>It's no use, Lord Zenon.</b>

10:45.110 --> 10:48.130
<b>I wish you good health. Farewell.</b>

11:05.360 --> 11:07.490
<b>Now, come and get me!</b>

11:08.560 --> 11:13.730
<b>Don't hold back. Think of me as the
demon who killed your parents.</b>

11:21.780 --> 11:25.270
<b>Not good enough! You won't
avenge them at this rate!</b>

11:29.080 --> 11:32.590
<b>What the heck? It's so noisy
so early in the morning.</b>

11:32.590 --> 11:34.720
<b>It's already noon, you stupid monkey.</b>

11:34.720 --> 11:37.350
<b>Really? I missed eating breakfast!</b>

11:39.790 --> 11:42.490
<b>I never knew he liked kids.</b>

11:43.400 --> 11:45.870
<b>Nothing, let's go eat lunch!</b>

11:46.830 --> 11:48.270
<b>Yay!</b>

11:50.540 --> 11:53.040
<b>You've got a pretty good knack for it.</b>

11:53.040 --> 11:56.170
<b>You might even be able to
defeat demons someday.</b>

12:02.150 --> 12:04.350
<b>Things are in a pretty sad state.</b>

12:04.350 --> 12:07.450
<b>Maybe you guys should abandon
this village already.</b>

12:08.360 --> 12:09.820
<b>They said we can't.</b>

12:11.490 --> 12:13.830
<b>Dad once said</b>

12:13.830 --> 12:16.820
<b>there's something very
precious in this village.</b>

12:18.370 --> 12:22.530
<b>We can't leave the village
because we have to protect it.</b>

12:23.500 --> 12:26.000
<b>He showed it to me just once.</b>

12:27.010 --> 12:28.870
<b>Don't tell me that precious thing...</b>

12:29.740 --> 12:32.410
<b>...is one of the Founding Scriptures of
Heaven and Earth?!</b>

12:32.410 --> 12:34.710
<b>Yeah, they said something like that.</b>

12:35.450 --> 12:37.510
<b>I've won first place big time.</b>

12:42.590 --> 12:43.830
<b>Seconds!</b>

12:43.830 --> 12:45.660
<b>Oh, yes, yes.</b>

12:45.660 --> 12:47.560
<b>You're eating too much, you stupid monkey.</b>

12:47.560 --> 12:50.290
<b>I can't help it! I didn't eat breakfast!</b>

12:50.870 --> 12:54.100
<b>Look at you, drinking wine during the
day, you pervy water sprite!</b>

12:54.100 --> 12:57.970
<b>What's wrong with that? We don't have
the nagging duo with us here!</b>

12:57.970 --> 12:59.440
<b>Lemme drink what I want.</b>

13:01.840 --> 13:04.980
<b>We were unable to save him in the end.</b>

13:04.980 --> 13:09.250
<b>Humans die when they die.
That's all there is to it.</b>

13:10.080 --> 13:11.550
<b>Master Sanzo!</b>

13:12.890 --> 13:14.890
<b>About those demons you mentioned...</b>

13:14.890 --> 13:16.890
<b>I have someone here who
might know something.</b>

13:16.890 --> 13:20.230
<b>If a large number of people were
kidnapped all at once,</b>

13:20.230 --> 13:22.860
<b>it may be the work of Ikaku.</b>

13:22.860 --> 13:24.370
<b>Ikaku?</b>

13:24.370 --> 13:27.340
<b>He's a demon who devours human souls.</b>

13:27.340 --> 13:30.910
<b>Not only that, he keeps the humans alive
after devouring their souls</b>

13:30.910 --> 13:33.570
<b>and prides himself on using them.</b>

13:36.440 --> 13:39.010
<b>And where's this demon now?</b>

13:39.010 --> 13:43.110
<b>According to rumors, the village of
Koton up ahead is his base.</b>

13:44.520 --> 13:47.220
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

13:47.220 --> 13:51.180
<b>We're supposed to meet up
with our friends in that village.</b>

14:04.340 --> 14:05.810
<b>That's the place.</b>

14:10.610 --> 14:12.170
<b>So there's a Scripture in there.</b>

14:22.260 --> 14:23.190
<b>Shunei...</b>

14:23.190 --> 14:24.090
<b>What is it?
Shunei...</b>

14:24.090 --> 14:24.690
<b>What is it?
I've lost family to a demon too.</b>

14:24.690 --> 14:27.320
<b>I've lost family to a demon too.</b>

14:28.900 --> 14:33.330
<b>My wife and son. If he were alive,
he'd be about your age.</b>

14:48.150 --> 14:49.710
<b>Mirei!</b>

14:53.290 --> 14:54.750
<b>I couldn't save her.</b>

14:56.820 --> 14:58.760
<b>Don't you die, Shunei.</b>

14:59.360 --> 15:02.850
<b>If you die, there are sure to be some
people who will have regrets.</b>

15:07.270 --> 15:08.740
<b>It's this room?</b>

15:20.110 --> 15:21.580
<b>All right.</b>

15:24.420 --> 15:25.720
<b>Shunei?</b>

15:25.720 --> 15:27.180
<b>Well...</b>

15:28.090 --> 15:33.320
<b>Don't worry. I won't hate you,
even if there's no Scripture.</b>

15:39.530 --> 15:41.660
<b>Zenon! It's a trap!</b>

15:42.700 --> 15:46.970
<b>The old couple at the inn fessed
up when we questioned them!</b>

15:46.970 --> 15:48.780
<b>All the people in this village</b>

15:48.780 --> 15:51.310
<b>were kidnapped and brought
here by a demon named Ikaku,</b>

15:51.310 --> 15:54.780
<b>and they're being forced to
help him defeat you guys.</b>

15:54.780 --> 15:56.550
<b>Even him!</b>

15:56.550 --> 15:58.020
<b>Hey, stop it!</b>

16:02.360 --> 16:03.890
<b>Zenon!</b>

16:03.890 --> 16:06.730
<b>Please! Zenon... Help Zenon!</b>

16:06.730 --> 16:08.060
<b>You...</b>

16:08.060 --> 16:09.560
<b>Zenon! Save Zenon!</b>

16:10.160 --> 16:16.900
<b>Surely even a god won't be able to
survive being bodily skewered.</b>

16:16.900 --> 16:18.170
<b>Who's there?!</b>

16:18.170 --> 16:19.340
<b>Are you Ikaku?!</b>

16:19.340 --> 16:22.610
<b>I was only ordered to eliminate
Homura's people,</b>

16:22.610 --> 16:26.170
<b>but I'll eliminate you people
too while I'm at it!</b>

16:29.520 --> 16:30.550
<b>Zenon! Zenon!</b>

16:30.550 --> 16:31.450
<b>Run, you idiot!
Zenon! Zenon!</b>

16:31.450 --> 16:32.050
<b>Run, you idiot!
Zenon!</b>

16:32.050 --> 16:33.150
<b>Zenon!</b>

16:37.660 --> 16:39.130
<b>That's as far as you go!</b>

16:46.800 --> 16:49.800
<b>So, you must be Ikaku!</b>

16:49.800 --> 16:53.070
<b>You'll be put to rest in this
land along with Zenon!</b>

16:53.070 --> 16:55.040
<b>I'm not sleepy yet!</b>

16:55.040 --> 16:56.510
<b>Prepare to attack!</b>

16:57.810 --> 17:01.420
<b>Please wait! If you attack now,
Shunei will also be...</b>

17:01.420 --> 17:06.190
<b>You promised to spare him
if he did as you said!</b>

17:06.190 --> 17:07.860
<b>Mom! Dad!</b>

17:07.860 --> 17:09.060
<b>Shunei!</b>

17:09.060 --> 17:11.660
<b>So, his parents being dead was a lie too.</b>

17:11.660 --> 17:14.830
<b>I've heard Gojyo and Goku aren't
to be taken lightly.</b>

17:14.830 --> 17:18.330
<b>If we let our guard down even a little,
they'll kill us.</b>

17:18.330 --> 17:20.970
<b>Resign yourselves that luck was
not on your side.</b>

17:20.970 --> 17:21.840
<b>No!</b>

17:21.840 --> 17:23.300
<b>Fire!</b>

17:28.410 --> 17:29.580
<b>This is...</b>

17:29.580 --> 17:30.950
<b>A machine gun!</b>

17:30.950 --> 17:32.450
<b>Impossible!</b>

17:32.450 --> 17:33.940
<b>Zenon!</b>

17:37.620 --> 17:39.750
<b>I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</b>

17:39.750 --> 17:41.310
<b>I knew.</b>

17:42.420 --> 17:44.630
<b>The tears you shed...</b>

17:44.630 --> 17:49.660
<b>Those weren't the tears of sorrow for
lost loved ones.</b>

17:49.660 --> 17:53.220
<b>They were tears of fear for the
possibility of losing them.</b>

17:53.830 --> 17:56.270
<b>Shoot! Shoot them to death!</b>

18:01.080 --> 18:02.540
<b>Here we go!</b>

18:04.380 --> 18:06.640
<b>Stay close to me.</b>

18:22.500 --> 18:24.000
<b>Not bad, kid.</b>

18:24.000 --> 18:26.060
<b>Because you taught me, Zenon.</b>

18:30.870 --> 18:35.110
<b>Stop it! Can't you hear me?! Stop it!</b>

18:35.110 --> 18:36.780
<b>Goku, get the boss pig!</b>

18:36.780 --> 18:38.240
<b>Got it!</b>

18:40.880 --> 18:42.750
<b>Stop, Goku!</b>

18:46.820 --> 18:49.220
<b>How dare you toy with people's hearts?!</b>

18:56.530 --> 18:57.330
<b>Shunei!</b>

18:57.330 --> 18:58.830
<b>What's going on here?</b>

18:58.830 --> 19:01.670
<b>All of their souls were devoured by Ikaku.</b>

19:03.540 --> 19:09.510
<b>If Ikaku dies, the souls that were in
his stomach will cease to exist,</b>

19:09.510 --> 19:10.980
<b>and everyone will die.</b>

19:33.900 --> 19:35.330
<b>Shunei!</b>

19:35.440 --> 19:36.900
<b>Shunei!</b>

19:37.500 --> 19:39.870
<b>Hey, open your eyes, Shunei!</b>

19:41.240 --> 19:43.540
<b>I told you not to die! Hey!</b>

19:44.980 --> 19:48.180
<b>This is probably my punishment for lying.</b>

19:49.280 --> 19:51.150
<b>When I go to the world beyond,</b>

19:51.150 --> 19:53.310
<b>I wonder if I'll get to meet your kid?</b>

19:55.490 --> 19:56.960
<b>I promise I'll be friends with him.</b>

19:57.560 --> 19:59.030
<b>So forgive me...</b>

19:59.760 --> 20:02.350
<b>Shunei! Shunei!</b>

20:25.990 --> 20:31.560
<b>Shunei, if you see my son, be
friends with him for me.</b>

20:31.560 --> 20:36.190
<b>You should get along with him,
just like you did with me.</b>

20:45.840 --> 20:54.650
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.020 --> 21:06.450
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:07.760 --> 21:17.900
<b>Emotions like the sand spilling
out of my hands</b>

21:19.240 --> 21:32.220
<b>The words that pierced my heart back
then suddenly ache</b>

21:32.220 --> 21:43.660
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:43.660 --> 21:54.940
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:54.940 --> 22:07.120
<b>Now, I can surely walk on and on forever</b>
